# flatpak
flatpak/.flatpak-builder/**
flatpak/ccache/**
flatpak/.flatpak-builder/build/**
flatpak/.flatpak-builder/shared-modules/**
flatpak/.flatpak-builder/shared-modules/*.tar.xz
flatpak/.flatpak-builder/debian-binary
flatpak/build/**
flatpak/repo/**
